Test Parameter Descriptions:
----------------------------
  Store    : NodeStore type - SEGMENT or DOCUMENT
  Nodes    : Total number of nodes to index
  Mode     : NORMAL or RESUME - traditional vs chunked with resume capability
  Chunk    : Node count per chunk - 0 means disabled
  ChunkMs  : Time limit per chunk in milliseconds - 0 means disabled
  PTTrav   : PathTree Traversal enabled - Y/N optimizes skip logic
  Time(s)  : Total indexing time in seconds
  Throughput: Nodes indexed per second
  Verified : Number of documents successfully indexed and searchable
  Runs     : Number of indexing cycles - 1 for NORMAL, multiple for RESUME

